{"3952620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snack Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 3952620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snack Shop Simulator</strong> is a first-person simulation game where your snack shop grows stronger the more you eat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras/76343502dd8ea4428c34cab11cba6bff.avif?t=1760120060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras_big/76343502dd8ea4428c34cab11cba6bff.webp?t=1760120060 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your in-game PC to order from <strong>45+ different snacks</strong>. Decide: eat them to gain power, or stock them in your shop to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras/53dabca330af32ac40961dab4f51d438.avif?t=1760120060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras_big/53dabca330af32ac40961dab4f51d438.webp?t=1760120060 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place shelves anywhere you like, then fill each slot with your chosen snacks to create the perfect layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952620/extras/ff8a6b4e93f92a59c1f7a9ea620fd0e9.avif?t=1760120060\" 